menu "LunarOS runtime"

config LUNAREDU_LUNAROS_MAINTENANCE_IO_CORE
    int "Core for LunarOS blocking network maintenance"
    range 0 1
    default 0
    help
        Runtime owns placement of its resident maintenance I/O task. Keep
        low-priority TLS work on the system/network core so foreground
        rendering on core 1 cannot starve connection setup. Audio and radio
        tasks retain their higher priorities. The core must exist on the target.

config LUNAREDU_LUNAROS_MAINTENANCE_IO_PRIORITY
    int "Priority for LunarOS blocking network maintenance"
    range 0 1
    default 1
    help
        Blocking TLS work must progress above idle during concurrent audio
        and display work. Input, audio and rendering retain higher priority.

endmenu
